definitely some downsides to it like the  pods themselves are actually really  quite flimsy they seem to be made out of  sort of plastic material and that means  that you can feel other people in their  pods sort of moving around or when they  get in and out and if you're really  sensitive to sort of disturbances that  night maybe you wouldn't get a very good  sleep  I found it okay but it's definitely you  can hear other people and whilst  everyone's been really respectful and  not made much noise it's definitely a  sense of not being totally isolated the  captions themselves don't make any noise  the inbuilt alarm wakes you up with  flashing lights which was a bit stifling  there is a TV - but it doesn't display  instructions in English and it was  pretty hard to use to be honest  [Music]
 

